        "body": "<p>Hello, I’m Thomas—the founder of Dried Petals Gallery.</p><p>My love for flowers began in my grandmother’s garden. It was always filled with quiet color and life, and as a child I was drawn to the small details—the shape of petals, the rhythm of leaves, the way flowers changed with the seasons. That early closeness to nature stayed with me.</p><p>Years later, pressing flowers became my way of preserving those moments—slowing time and honoring beauty that would otherwise fade. What began as a personal practice grew into Dried Petals Gallery.</p><p>Today, every frame is handcrafted with care. Each petal is selected and arranged by hand, never rushed or mass-produced. Guided by respect for nature and sustainability, our designs are minimal, timeless, and made to live beautifully in your home for years to come.</p>",
